import { readFile, mkdir, access, writeFile } from 'node:fs/promises';
import path from 'node:path';
import { Project, Note, Content, Media, BuildOptions, CompareOptions } from 'ankiforge';

interface Dataset {
  namespace: string;
  deck: string;
  notes: { id: string; front: string; back: string }[];
}

async function project(source: string, version: string): Promise<Project> {
  const data: Dataset = JSON.parse(await readFile(path.join(source, version), 'utf8'));
  const image = await Media.file(path.join(source, 'cell.png'));
  const audio = await Media.file(path.join(source, 'tone.wav'));
  const result = new Project(data.namespace).defaultDeck(data.deck);
  for (const row of data.notes) {
    const front = Content.sequence([row.front, image.image(), audio.sound()]);
    result.add(row.id, Note.basic(front, row.back));
  }
  return result;
}

const source = process.argv[2] ?? 'recipe';
const output = process.argv[3] ?? 'output/node';
await mkdir(output, { recursive: true });
const baseline = path.join(output, 'v1.apkg');
const candidate = path.join(output, 'v2.apkg');
for (const file of [baseline, candidate]) {
  const exists = await access(file).then(() => true, error => {
    if (error.code === 'ENOENT') return false;
    throw error;
  });
  if (exists) throw new Error('Choose a fresh output directory; keep original releases');
}
const first = await (await project(source, 'v1.json')).build(BuildOptions.to(baseline));
await first.artifact.close();
const next = await project(source, 'v2.json');
const comparison = await next.compare(CompareOptions.against(baseline));
await writeFile(path.join(output, 'comparison.json'), JSON.stringify(comparison.snapshot(), null, 2));
if (!comparison.policy.allows_publication) {
  throw new Error('Comparison policy blocked publication; inspect comparison.json');
}
const prepared = await next.preparePublication(BuildOptions.to(candidate).updateFrom(baseline));
try {
  const review = prepared.report.comparison;
  if (!review) throw new Error('Missing update comparison');
  await writeFile(path.join(output, 'review.json'), JSON.stringify(review.snapshot(), null, 2));
  if (!review.policy.allows_publication) throw new Error('Prepared candidate blocked; inspect review.json');
  const result = await prepared.publish();
  console.log(result.artifact.path);
  await result.artifact.close();
} finally {
  await prepared.close();
}

docs/image-occlusion.md.text:
# Image Occlusion

Create a structured image-occlusion note from an owned image and rectangles.
Each mask needs a stable key that continues to identify the same region through
later versions. The note joins a project through the ordinary `add(key, note)`
path.

## Run the example

```sh
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example docs_workflow -- target/docs-examples
```

Open `target/docs-examples/diagram.apkg` in Anki. The complete executable loads
the repository's occlusion image and checks one note, one card and one asset.

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/docs_workflow.rs#occlusion -->
```rust
fn occlusion(output: &Path, diagram: &Path) -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let image = Media::file(diagram)?;
    let note = Note::image_occlusion(image)
        .mask(Mask::rect("region-1", 10, 10, 40, 25))
        .build()?;
    let mut project = Project::new("docs-diagram")?.default_deck("Diagram");
    project.add("diagram", note)?;
    let built = project.build(BuildOptions::to(output.join("diagram.apkg")))?;
    verify(&built, 1, 1, 1)?;
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

## Multiple masks and modes

This standalone example expects `fixtures/occlusion.png`, a decoded image at
least 80×80 pixels:

```rust
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Media, Note, Project};
use ankiforge::note::{Mask, OcclusionMode};

fn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let note = Note::image_occlusion(Media::file("fixtures/occlusion.png")?)
        .mask(Mask::rect("nucleus", 10, 10, 20, 20))
        .mask(Mask::rect("wall", 50, 50, 20, 20))
        .mode(OcclusionMode::HideOneGuessOne)
        .build()?
        .field("header", "Cell structure")
        .field("back_extra", "Review the diagram.");
    let mut project = Project::new("cell-diagram")?;
    project.add("cell", note)?;
    let output = project.build(BuildOptions::to("cell-diagram.apkg"))?;
    assert_eq!(output.report().counts().cards, 2);
    Ok(())
}
```

`HideAllGuessOne` is the default; `HideOneGuessOne` is also supported. Each keyed
mask produces its own cloze card. Coordinates are finite pixel values on the
displayed image, after EXIF orientation. The library fully decodes PNG, JPEG,
GIF, WebP and BMP; the decoded buffer budget is 256 MiB, independent of the
compressed media import budget. Rectangles must have positive dimensions, lie
inside the image and use unique nonempty keys.

The builder validates the image and masks before returning a `Note`. Use ordinary
`field` assignments for `header`, `back_extra` and `comments`; the generated
`image` and `occlusion` fields are reserved and cannot be overridden.

When updating from a previous distribution, mask keys preserve card ordinals
across ordering changes. Removed masks reserve their ordinals; restoring the
same key reuses the ordinal. New keys never inherit another mask's identity.
The supported allocation is 1–500, and exhaustion fails explicitly. Removing or
adding masks is visible in [update risk analysis](updates.md); omission from an
APKG does not delete a learner's existing card.

docs/json-to-anki.md.text:
# Generate and update Anki decks from JSON

Read three biology questions from JSON, add a shared image and audio clip, and
export an original APKG plus a reviewed answer-only update. Each release should
contain **3 notes, 3 cards and 2 media files**. Choose one SDK below; each is a
complete program. Normal export needs no Anki installation.

Maintained by Anki Forge maintainers · reviewed 2026-10-25.

## Shared inputs

Download [v1.json](recipes/json-to-anki/v1.json), [v2.json](recipes/json-to-anki/v2.json),
[cell.png](recipes/json-to-anki/cell.png) and [tone.wav](recipes/json-to-anki/tone.wav).
The image is a cell diagram; the audio is a short generated tone, not spoken vocabulary.
In each new application directory, put these four files in `recipe/`:

```text
json-deck/
  recipe/
    v1.json
    v2.json
    cell.png
    tone.wav
```

Both JSON files contain `namespace`, `deck` and three `notes` with durable `id`,
`front` and `back` values. v2 changes only the first answer. The caller parses JSON;
Anki Forge handles authoring and APKG generation. For untrusted inputs, validate
your application's schema before constructing notes.

## Rust

Rust 1.92+. JSON parsing uses `serde` and `serde_json`. Use public Anki Forge 0.3.1.

```sh
cargo new json-deck
cd json-deck
cargo add ankiforge@0.3.1
cargo add serde --features derive
cargo add serde_json
```

Save as `src/main.rs` (create `recipe/` alongside `Cargo.toml`):

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/json_to_anki.rs -->
```rust
use ankiforge::update::CompareOptions;
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Content, Media, Note, Project};
use serde::Deserialize;
use std::{fs, path::Path};

#[derive(Deserialize)]
struct Dataset {
    namespace: String,
    deck: String,
    notes: Vec<Row>,
}

#[derive(Deserialize)]
struct Row {
    id: String,
    front: String,
    back: String,
}

fn project(input: &Path, version: &str) -> Result<Project, Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let data: Dataset = serde_json::from_slice(&fs::read(input.join(version))?)?;
    let image = Media::file(input.join("cell.png"))?;
    let audio = Media::file(input.join("tone.wav"))?;
    let mut project = Project::new(data.namespace)?.default_deck(data.deck);
    for row in data.notes {
        let front = Content::sequence([Content::text(row.front), image.image(), audio.sound()]);
        project.add(row.id, Note::basic(front, row.back))?;
    }
    Ok(project)
}

fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let args: Vec<_> = std::env::args().collect();
    let input = Path::new(args.get(1).map(String::as_str).unwrap_or("recipe"));
    let output = Path::new(args.get(2).map(String::as_str).unwrap_or("output/rust"));
    fs::create_dir_all(output)?;
    let baseline = output.join("v1.apkg");
    let candidate = output.join("v2.apkg");
    if baseline.exists() || candidate.exists() {
        return Err("Choose a fresh output directory; keep original releases".into());
    }
    project(input, "v1.json")?.build(BuildOptions::to(&baseline))?;
    let next = project(input, "v2.json")?;
    let comparison = next.compare(CompareOptions::against(&baseline))?;
    fs::write(
        output.join("comparison.json"),
        serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&comparison.snapshot())?,
    )?;
    if !comparison.policy().allows_publication() {
        return Err("Comparison policy blocked publication; inspect comparison.json".into());
    }
    let prepared = next.prepare_publication(BuildOptions::to(&candidate).update_from(&baseline))?;
    let review = prepared
        .report()
        .comparison()
        .ok_or("Missing update comparison")?;
    fs::write(
        output.join("review.json"),
        serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&review.snapshot())?,
    )?;
    if !review.policy().allows_publication() {
        return Err("Prepared candidate blocked; inspect review.json".into());
    }
    let result = prepared.publish()?;
    println!("{}", result.artifact().path().display());
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

```sh
cargo run -- recipe output/rust
```

## Python

Ordinary CPython 3.11+ with a platform wheel; 3.11–3.14 is covered by release checks. On Windows, activate with `.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1`. Use public Anki Forge 0.3.1.

```sh
mkdir json-deck
cd json-deck
python -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install ankiforge==0.3.1
```

Save as `main.py` (create `recipe/` alongside `main.py`):

<!-- source: bindings/python/examples/json_to_anki.py -->
```python
"""Generate and review an answer-only update from caller-parsed JSON."""
import json
from pathlib import Path
import sys
from ankiforge import BuildOptions, CompareOptions, Content, Media, Note, Project


def project(source: Path, version: str) -> Project:
    data = json.loads((source / version).read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
    image = Media.file(source / 'cell.png')
    audio = Media.file(source / 'tone.wav')
    result = Project(data['namespace'], default_deck=data['deck'])
    for row in data['notes']:
        front = Content.sequence([row['front'], image.image(), audio.sound()])
        result.add(row['id'], Note.basic(front, row['back']))
    return result


source = Path(sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else 'recipe')
output = Path(sys.argv[2] if len(sys.argv) > 2 else 'output/python')
output.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
baseline, candidate = output / 'v1.apkg', output / 'v2.apkg'
if baseline.exists() or candidate.exists():
    raise RuntimeError('Choose a fresh output directory; keep original releases')
project(source, 'v1.json').build(BuildOptions.to(baseline))
next_project = project(source, 'v2.json')
comparison = next_project.compare(CompareOptions.against(baseline))
(output / 'comparison.json').write_text(json.dumps(comparison.snapshot(), indent=2), encoding='utf-8')
if not comparison.allows_publication:
    raise RuntimeError('Comparison policy blocked publication; inspect comparison.json')
prepared = next_project.prepare_publication(BuildOptions.to(candidate).update_from(baseline))
try:
    review = prepared.report.comparison
    if review is None:
        raise RuntimeError('Missing update comparison')
    (output / 'review.json').write_text(json.dumps(review.snapshot(), indent=2), encoding='utf-8')
    if not review.allows_publication:
        raise RuntimeError('Prepared candidate blocked; inspect review.json')
    result = prepared.publish()
    print(result.artifact.path)
finally:
    prepared.close()
```
<!-- /source -->

```sh
python main.py recipe output/python
```

## Node

Node.js 22.13+ and a matching native optional dependency. This program compiles TypeScript to JavaScript and runs on Node.js. Use public Anki Forge 0.3.1.

```sh
mkdir json-deck
cd json-deck
npm init -y
npm install --include=optional ankiforge@0.3.1
npm install --save-dev typescript@6.0.3 @types/node@24.13.6
```

Save as `main.mts` (create `recipe/` alongside `main.mts`):

<!-- source: bindings/node/examples/json_to_anki.mts -->
```typescript
import { readFile, mkdir, access, writeFile } from 'node:fs/promises';
import path from 'node:path';
import { Project, Note, Content, Media, BuildOptions, CompareOptions } from 'ankiforge';

interface Dataset {
  namespace: string;
  deck: string;
  notes: { id: string; front: string; back: string }[];
}

async function project(source: string, version: string): Promise<Project> {
  const data: Dataset = JSON.parse(await readFile(path.join(source, version), 'utf8'));
  const image = await Media.file(path.join(source, 'cell.png'));
  const audio = await Media.file(path.join(source, 'tone.wav'));
  const result = new Project(data.namespace).defaultDeck(data.deck);
  for (const row of data.notes) {
    const front = Content.sequence([row.front, image.image(), audio.sound()]);
    result.add(row.id, Note.basic(front, row.back));
  }
  return result;
}

const source = process.argv[2] ?? 'recipe';
const output = process.argv[3] ?? 'output/node';
await mkdir(output, { recursive: true });
const baseline = path.join(output, 'v1.apkg');
const candidate = path.join(output, 'v2.apkg');
for (const file of [baseline, candidate]) {
  const exists = await access(file).then(() => true, error => {
    if (error.code === 'ENOENT') return false;
    throw error;
  });
  if (exists) throw new Error('Choose a fresh output directory; keep original releases');
}
const first = await (await project(source, 'v1.json')).build(BuildOptions.to(baseline));
await first.artifact.close();
const next = await project(source, 'v2.json');
const comparison = await next.compare(CompareOptions.against(baseline));
await writeFile(path.join(output, 'comparison.json'), JSON.stringify(comparison.snapshot(), null, 2));
if (!comparison.policy.allows_publication) {
  throw new Error('Comparison policy blocked publication; inspect comparison.json');
}
const prepared = await next.preparePublication(BuildOptions.to(candidate).updateFrom(baseline));
try {
  const review = prepared.report.comparison;
  if (!review) throw new Error('Missing update comparison');
  await writeFile(path.join(output, 'review.json'), JSON.stringify(review.snapshot(), null, 2));
  if (!review.policy.allows_publication) throw new Error('Prepared candidate blocked; inspect review.json');
  const result = await prepared.publish();
  console.log(result.artifact.path);
  await result.artifact.close();
} finally {
  await prepared.close();
}
```
<!-- /source -->

```sh
npx tsc main.mts --target ES2022 --module NodeNext --moduleResolution NodeNext --strict --outDir dist --types node
node dist/main.mjs recipe output/node
```

## Check and import the result

The selected program prints `output/<language>/v2.apkg`. Keep `v1.apkg` alongside
it; `comparison.json` and `review.json` record `RISK.NOTE_CHANGED`, no added or
removed notes, and `policy.allows_publication: true` for this answer-only edit.
The program checks the policy again on the prepared candidate before publishing.
It refuses to reuse an output directory containing either release.

Import `v1.apkg` into Anki: expect the Biology deck with three Basic cards, the
cell image and the tone. Then import `v2.apkg`: check that the first answer becomes
“The basic structural and functional unit of life”, with three notes remaining.
The namespace `biology-json` identifies this publishing project. Each business ID
is a stable note key; Anki Forge derives the GUID used by Anki from that identity.
Keep the namespace and those three keys unchanged.

Use the **original distribution** v1 APKG as the update baseline, never an Anki
re-export. Client import matching, local edits and scheduling depend on Anki
version, note types and import settings; validate your target client before a
release. Importing a package does not remove notes omitted from a later package.
A successful compare/build is not a guarantee about every learner's review state.

See [update conditions](updates.md), [media](media.md), [API navigation](api-overview.md)
and [library selection](anki-forge-vs-genanki.md).

docs/updates.md.text:
# Update and distribute a publication

Keep the project namespace and note/model/field/template keys stable. Build each
new release from the previous **original distribution APKG**, which carries
complete versioned identity evidence. Save that package with its source revision.

## Run two versions and compare

```sh
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example docs_workflow -- target/docs-examples
```

This writes `spanish-v1.apkg` and `spanish-v2.apkg`, compares the changed answer,
and checks the updated package counts. The executable source is:

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/docs_workflow.rs#updates -->
```rust
fn vocabulary(answer: &str) -> anyhow::Result<Project> {
    let mut project = Project::new("docs-spanish-updates")?.default_deck("Spanish");
    project.add("hola", Note::basic("hola", answer))?;
    Ok(project)
}

fn updates(output: &Path) -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let previous = output.join("spanish-v1.apkg");
    let next = output.join("spanish-v2.apkg");
    vocabulary("hello")?.build(BuildOptions::to(&previous))?;
    let project = vocabulary("hello; hi")?;
    let comparison = project.compare(CompareOptions::against(&previous))?;
    ensure!(comparison.policy().allows_publication());
    let built = project.build(BuildOptions::to(&next).update_from(&previous))?;
    verify(&built, 1, 1, 0)?;
    ensure!(built.report().comparison().is_some());
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

`compare` completes successfully even when findings would block publication.
Read `comparison.policy().allows_publication()` separately from the original
risk level and evidence. `build(...update_from(...))` runs the same analysis and
returns `BuildError` if its policy blocks the candidate, before publication.

## Policy and inspection limits

This full program selects a stricter threshold and uses the same configuration
for comparison and update:

```rust
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Note, Project};
use ankiforge::build::InspectLimits;
use ankiforge::update::{CompareOptions, RiskLevel, UpdatePolicy};

fn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let mut first = Project::new("policy-example")?;
    first.add("cell", Note::basic("Cell?", "Unit of life"))?;
    first.build(BuildOptions::to("policy-v1.apkg"))?;
    let mut next = Project::new("policy-example")?;
    next.add("cell", Note::basic("Cell?", "The basic unit of life"))?;
    let mut limits = InspectLimits::default();
    limits.max_collection_bytes = 1 << 30;
    let policy = UpdatePolicy::default().fail_on(RiskLevel::Medium);
    let comparison = next.compare(CompareOptions::against("policy-v1.apkg")
        .inspect_limits(limits.clone()).update_policy(policy.clone()))?;
    assert!(comparison.policy().allows_publication());
    next.build(BuildOptions::to("policy-v2.apkg").update_from("policy-v1.apkg")
        .inspect_limits(limits).update_policy(policy))?;
    Ok(())
}
```

The default policy blocks High and Critical findings. After reviewing a specific
category, a caller can deliberately choose
`UpdatePolicy::default().allow(RiskCode::NoteRemoved)`. It accepts **all findings
in that category**, retaining their original level and evidence. It does not
claim to approve selected notes individually. An allowance with no matching
finding produces a warning; unknown risk codes are rejected. Do not automatically
allow every code returned by a comparison.

Missing or corrupt evidence, namespace mismatch, invalid candidate data and
inspection limits are hard errors, not allowable risk categories. Comparison
returns an error with completed observations when analysis cannot finish.
Explicit policy on a create request without `update_from` is a configuration
error regardless of setter order.

## Evidence and identity

The package includes `ankiforge-identity.json` with the
`ankiforge-identity-v1` format. It binds model/config IDs, note GUIDs, historical
field/template slots, card/mask ordinals, revisions and media to the actual
collection and payloads. Anki re-export does not preserve this evidence and is
not a usable update baseline. Missing evidence is never silently reconstructed.

Display-name and content edits preserve identity keys. Unchanged content keeps
its baseline revision; changed content advances it. Reordering fields/templates
preserves historical mappings. Retired identities remain reserved so that
restoring the same key can reuse them. A note key cannot move to another model,
and a model key cannot change between normal and Cloze kinds.

## Client import behavior and release review

An APKG is a distribution package, not deletion synchronization. Omitting notes,
fields, templates or masks does not delete existing learner data. Field/template
schema changes and sort-field changes are high-risk because Anki merge and import
settings affect their behavior. Schema changes can copy models or update target
note timestamps before note-content comparison.

Test first import and updates into an existing collection on the clients you
support. Check fields, GUIDs, card sets, local edits and existing scheduling with
the intended merge and note-update settings. Stable identity alone does not
promise that newer local edits are overwritten or deleted history is restored.

Write candidates to a path separate from the archived baseline. After review,
distribute the accepted package and retain it as the next release's evidence.
See [build guarantees](build-guarantees.md) for ownership and publication facts.

<a id="build-once-review-then-publish-from-source"></a>

## Build once, review then publish

This API is included in the public `0.3.1` package.

Build once, inspect the report, then publish the same candidate file. Reviewing
and then running a second ordinary build creates another candidate; prepared
publication keeps the actual APKG tied to the reviewed report.

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/docs_publication.rs -->
```rust
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Note, Project};

fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let mut project = Project::new("spanish")?.default_deck("Spanish");
    project.add("es:hola", Note::basic("hola", "hello"))?;
    project.build(BuildOptions::to("spanish-original.apkg"))?;

    let mut next = Project::new("spanish")?.default_deck("Spanish");
    next.add("es:hola", Note::basic("hola", "hello; hi"))?;
    let prepared = next.prepare_publication(
        BuildOptions::to("spanish-reviewed.apkg").update_from("spanish-original.apkg"),
    )?;
    println!("{:?}", prepared.report().comparison());
    if prepared
        .report()
        .comparison()
        .is_some_and(|report| report.policy().allows_publication())
    {
        let output = prepared.publish()?;
        println!("{}", output.artifact().path().display());
    }
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

From the pinned source checkout, save the complete program above as
`anki_forge/examples/docs_publication.rs` (this guide adds the example; it is not
bundled in `1199196`). Then run:

```sh
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example docs_publication
```

The example writes `spanish-original.apkg` and, when the policy allows publication,
`spanish-reviewed.apkg` to the repository root.
Preparation does not publish the destination. Review the findings and test your
client import before approving distribution; the example automatically publishes
only this simple content edit when its policy allows it. The benchmark does not
measure this workflow.

See [build lifecycle](build-guarantees.md#prepared-publication-from-source),
[Rust API](rust-api.md#review-once-publish-once),
[Node API](node/api.md#prepare-review-and-publish) and
[Python API](python/api.md#prepare-review-and-publish).

docs/zh-cn/image-occlusion.md.text:
# 图片遮挡

使用拥有所有权的图像与矩形创建结构化图片遮挡笔记。每个遮罩需要稳定键，在后续版本中继续标识同一区域。笔记通过普通 `add(key, note)` 加入项目。

## 运行示例

```sh
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example docs_workflow -- target/docs-examples
```

在 Anki 中打开 `target/docs-examples/diagram.apkg`。完整可执行程序加载仓库的遮挡图像，并检查一条笔记、一张卡片和一个资源。

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/docs_workflow.rs#occlusion -->
```rust
fn occlusion(output: &Path, diagram: &Path) -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let image = Media::file(diagram)?;
    let note = Note::image_occlusion(image)
        .mask(Mask::rect("region-1", 10, 10, 40, 25))
        .build()?;
    let mut project = Project::new("docs-diagram")?.default_deck("Diagram");
    project.add("diagram", note)?;
    let built = project.build(BuildOptions::to(output.join("diagram.apkg")))?;
    verify(&built, 1, 1, 1)?;
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

## 多个遮罩与模式

此独立示例需要 `fixtures/occlusion.png`，解码后的图像至少为 80×80 像素：

```rust
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Media, Note, Project};
use ankiforge::note::{Mask, OcclusionMode};

fn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let note = Note::image_occlusion(Media::file("fixtures/occlusion.png")?)
        .mask(Mask::rect("nucleus", 10, 10, 20, 20))
        .mask(Mask::rect("wall", 50, 50, 20, 20))
        .mode(OcclusionMode::HideOneGuessOne)
        .build()?
        .field("header", "Cell structure")
        .field("back_extra", "Review the diagram.");
    let mut project = Project::new("cell-diagram")?;
    project.add("cell", note)?;
    let output = project.build(BuildOptions::to("cell-diagram.apkg"))?;
    assert_eq!(output.report().counts().cards, 2);
    Ok(())
}
```

默认模式为 `HideAllGuessOne`，也支持 `HideOneGuessOne`。每个带键遮罩生成自己的 Cloze 卡片。坐标是应用 EXIF 方向后的显示图像上的有限像素值。库完整解码 PNG、JPEG、GIF、WebP 和 BMP；解码缓冲预算为 256 MiB，与压缩媒体的导入预算独立。矩形尺寸必须为正、位于图像内，并使用唯一的非空键。

构建器在返回 `Note` 前校验图像和遮罩。使用普通 `field` 为 `header`、`back_extra` 和 `comments` 赋值；自动生成的 `image` 和 `occlusion` 字段为保留字段，不能覆盖。

基于之前分发的包更新时，遮罩键会在顺序改变后保留卡片序号。已移除遮罩的序号仍被保留；恢复相同键会复用原序号。新键不会继承其他遮罩的身份。支持的分配范围为 1–500，用尽时明确失败。删除或添加遮罩会出现在[更新风险分析](../updates.md)中；APKG 中省略卡片不会删除学习者已有的卡片。

docs/zh-cn/json-to-anki.md.text:
# 用 JSON 数据生成并更新 Anki 牌组

从 JSON 读取三个生物学问题，添加共享图片与音频，导出原始 APKG 和经过检查的仅修改答案的更新。每个版本应包含 **3 条笔记、3 张卡片和 2 个媒体文件**。选择下方任一 SDK，每份都是完整程序。普通导出不需要安装 Anki。

由 Anki Forge 维护者维护 · 2026-10-25 复核。

## 共享输入

下载 [v1.json](../recipes/json-to-anki/v1.json)、[v2.json](../recipes/json-to-anki/v2.json)、[cell.png](../recipes/json-to-anki/cell.png) 和 [tone.wav](../recipes/json-to-anki/tone.wav)。图片是细胞示意图；音频是短合成音，并非词汇朗读。在每个新应用目录中，将这四个文件放入 `recipe/`：

```text
json-deck/
  recipe/
    v1.json
    v2.json
    cell.png
    tone.wav
```

两份 JSON 都包含 `namespace`、`deck` 和三条 `notes`，每条有持久 `id`、`front` 与 `back`。v2 只改变第一个答案。JSON 由调用方解析；Anki Forge 负责内容编写和 APKG 生成。对于不可信输入，创建笔记前应校验应用自己的 schema。

## Rust

Rust 1.92+。JSON 解析使用 `serde` 与 `serde_json`。使用公开 Anki Forge 0.3.1。

```sh
cargo new json-deck
cd json-deck
cargo add ankiforge@0.3.1
cargo add serde --features derive
cargo add serde_json
```

保存为 `src/main.rs`（在 `Cargo.toml` 同级创建 `recipe/`）：

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/json_to_anki.rs -->
```rust
use ankiforge::update::CompareOptions;
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Content, Media, Note, Project};
use serde::Deserialize;
use std::{fs, path::Path};

#[derive(Deserialize)]
struct Dataset {
    namespace: String,
    deck: String,
    notes: Vec<Row>,
}

#[derive(Deserialize)]
struct Row {
    id: String,
    front: String,
    back: String,
}

fn project(input: &Path, version: &str) -> Result<Project, Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let data: Dataset = serde_json::from_slice(&fs::read(input.join(version))?)?;
    let image = Media::file(input.join("cell.png"))?;
    let audio = Media::file(input.join("tone.wav"))?;
    let mut project = Project::new(data.namespace)?.default_deck(data.deck);
    for row in data.notes {
        let front = Content::sequence([Content::text(row.front), image.image(), audio.sound()]);
        project.add(row.id, Note::basic(front, row.back))?;
    }
    Ok(project)
}

fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let args: Vec<_> = std::env::args().collect();
    let input = Path::new(args.get(1).map(String::as_str).unwrap_or("recipe"));
    let output = Path::new(args.get(2).map(String::as_str).unwrap_or("output/rust"));
    fs::create_dir_all(output)?;
    let baseline = output.join("v1.apkg");
    let candidate = output.join("v2.apkg");
    if baseline.exists() || candidate.exists() {
        return Err("Choose a fresh output directory; keep original releases".into());
    }
    project(input, "v1.json")?.build(BuildOptions::to(&baseline))?;
    let next = project(input, "v2.json")?;
    let comparison = next.compare(CompareOptions::against(&baseline))?;
    fs::write(
        output.join("comparison.json"),
        serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&comparison.snapshot())?,
    )?;
    if !comparison.policy().allows_publication() {
        return Err("Comparison policy blocked publication; inspect comparison.json".into());
    }
    let prepared = next.prepare_publication(BuildOptions::to(&candidate).update_from(&baseline))?;
    let review = prepared
        .report()
        .comparison()
        .ok_or("Missing update comparison")?;
    fs::write(
        output.join("review.json"),
        serde_json::to_vec_pretty(&review.snapshot())?,
    )?;
    if !review.policy().allows_publication() {
        return Err("Prepared candidate blocked; inspect review.json".into());
    }
    let result = prepared.publish()?;
    println!("{}", result.artifact().path().display());
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

```sh
cargo run -- recipe output/rust
```

## Python

普通 CPython 3.11+ 及匹配平台 wheel；发布检查覆盖 3.11–3.14。Windows 使用 `.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1` 激活。使用公开 Anki Forge 0.3.1。

```sh
mkdir json-deck
cd json-deck
python -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install ankiforge==0.3.1
```

保存为 `main.py`（在 `main.py` 同级创建 `recipe/`）：

<!-- source: bindings/python/examples/json_to_anki.py -->
```python
"""Generate and review an answer-only update from caller-parsed JSON."""
import json
from pathlib import Path
import sys
from ankiforge import BuildOptions, CompareOptions, Content, Media, Note, Project


def project(source: Path, version: str) -> Project:
    data = json.loads((source / version).read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
    image = Media.file(source / 'cell.png')
    audio = Media.file(source / 'tone.wav')
    result = Project(data['namespace'], default_deck=data['deck'])
    for row in data['notes']:
        front = Content.sequence([row['front'], image.image(), audio.sound()])
        result.add(row['id'], Note.basic(front, row['back']))
    return result


source = Path(sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else 'recipe')
output = Path(sys.argv[2] if len(sys.argv) > 2 else 'output/python')
output.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
baseline, candidate = output / 'v1.apkg', output / 'v2.apkg'
if baseline.exists() or candidate.exists():
    raise RuntimeError('Choose a fresh output directory; keep original releases')
project(source, 'v1.json').build(BuildOptions.to(baseline))
next_project = project(source, 'v2.json')
comparison = next_project.compare(CompareOptions.against(baseline))
(output / 'comparison.json').write_text(json.dumps(comparison.snapshot(), indent=2), encoding='utf-8')
if not comparison.allows_publication:
    raise RuntimeError('Comparison policy blocked publication; inspect comparison.json')
prepared = next_project.prepare_publication(BuildOptions.to(candidate).update_from(baseline))
try:
    review = prepared.report.comparison
    if review is None:
        raise RuntimeError('Missing update comparison')
    (output / 'review.json').write_text(json.dumps(review.snapshot(), indent=2), encoding='utf-8')
    if not review.allows_publication:
        raise RuntimeError('Prepared candidate blocked; inspect review.json')
    result = prepared.publish()
    print(result.artifact.path)
finally:
    prepared.close()
```
<!-- /source -->

```sh
python main.py recipe output/python
```

## Node

Node.js 22.13+ 及匹配原生可选依赖。程序将 TypeScript 编译为 JavaScript，再在 Node.js 上运行。使用公开 Anki Forge 0.3.1。

```sh
mkdir json-deck
cd json-deck
npm init -y
npm install --include=optional ankiforge@0.3.1
npm install --save-dev typescript@6.0.3 @types/node@24.13.6
```

保存为 `main.mts`（在 `main.mts` 同级创建 `recipe/`）：

<!-- source: bindings/node/examples/json_to_anki.mts -->
```typescript
import { readFile, mkdir, access, writeFile } from 'node:fs/promises';
import path from 'node:path';
import { Project, Note, Content, Media, BuildOptions, CompareOptions } from 'ankiforge';

interface Dataset {
  namespace: string;
  deck: string;
  notes: { id: string; front: string; back: string }[];
}

async function project(source: string, version: string): Promise<Project> {
  const data: Dataset = JSON.parse(await readFile(path.join(source, version), 'utf8'));
  const image = await Media.file(path.join(source, 'cell.png'));
  const audio = await Media.file(path.join(source, 'tone.wav'));
  const result = new Project(data.namespace).defaultDeck(data.deck);
  for (const row of data.notes) {
    const front = Content.sequence([row.front, image.image(), audio.sound()]);
    result.add(row.id, Note.basic(front, row.back));
  }
  return result;
}

const source = process.argv[2] ?? 'recipe';
const output = process.argv[3] ?? 'output/node';
await mkdir(output, { recursive: true });
const baseline = path.join(output, 'v1.apkg');
const candidate = path.join(output, 'v2.apkg');
for (const file of [baseline, candidate]) {
  const exists = await access(file).then(() => true, error => {
    if (error.code === 'ENOENT') return false;
    throw error;
  });
  if (exists) throw new Error('Choose a fresh output directory; keep original releases');
}
const first = await (await project(source, 'v1.json')).build(BuildOptions.to(baseline));
await first.artifact.close();
const next = await project(source, 'v2.json');
const comparison = await next.compare(CompareOptions.against(baseline));
await writeFile(path.join(output, 'comparison.json'), JSON.stringify(comparison.snapshot(), null, 2));
if (!comparison.policy.allows_publication) {
  throw new Error('Comparison policy blocked publication; inspect comparison.json');
}
const prepared = await next.preparePublication(BuildOptions.to(candidate).updateFrom(baseline));
try {
  const review = prepared.report.comparison;
  if (!review) throw new Error('Missing update comparison');
  await writeFile(path.join(output, 'review.json'), JSON.stringify(review.snapshot(), null, 2));
  if (!review.policy.allows_publication) throw new Error('Prepared candidate blocked; inspect review.json');
  const result = await prepared.publish();
  console.log(result.artifact.path);
  await result.artifact.close();
} finally {
  await prepared.close();
}
```
<!-- /source -->

```sh
npx tsc main.mts --target ES2022 --module NodeNext --moduleResolution NodeNext --strict --outDir dist --types node
node dist/main.mjs recipe output/node
```

## 检查并导入结果

所选程序输出 `output/<language>/v2.apkg`。将 `v1.apkg` 保留在旁边；`comparison.json` 和 `review.json` 记录 `RISK.NOTE_CHANGED`，没有新增或移除笔记，且对这次仅修改答案的编辑给出 `policy.allows_publication: true`。发布前，程序在预备候选包上再次检查策略。它拒绝复用已包含任一版本的输出目录。

将 `v1.apkg` 导入 Anki，应看到 Biology 牌组的三张 Basic 卡片、细胞图片与合成音。再导入 `v2.apkg`，检查第一个答案变成“The basic structural and functional unit of life”，且仍有三条笔记。命名空间 `biology-json` 标识该发布项目。每个业务 ID 是稳定笔记键；Anki Forge 根据该身份派生 Anki 使用的 GUID。保持命名空间和这三个键不变。

更新基线必须是**原始分发** v1 APKG，不能使用 Anki 重新导出的文件。客户端导入匹配、本地编辑和调度取决于 Anki 版本、笔记类型与导入设置；发布前验证目标客户端。导入包不会删除后续包中省略的笔记。比较或构建成功不保证每位学习者的复习状态。

参见[更新条件](../updates.md)、[媒体](../media.md)、[API 导航](../api-overview.md)和[选库指南](../anki-forge-vs-genanki.md)。

docs/zh-cn/media.md.text:
# 图片与音频

`Media` 值拥有不可变快照。使用 `Media::file` 导入文件，或通过带显式 MIME 类型的 `Media::bytes` 导入原生字节。成功导入后，修改或删除源文件都不会改变该资源。克隆共享存储，可跨项目使用。

## 运行媒体流程

在仓库根目录运行：

```sh
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example docs_workflow -- target/docs-examples
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example target_api_media
```

该流程使用仓库 PNG/WAV 测试素材，写出包含一条笔记、一张卡片和三个资源的 `media.apkg`。第二个示例自行生成小图像和音频，包含 CSS 引用及显式声明的媒体，并写出 `spanish-media.apkg`。

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/docs_workflow.rs#media -->
```rust
fn media(output: &Path, image: &Path, sound: &Path) -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let image = Media::file(image)?.with_export_name("cell.png")?;
    let sound = Media::file(sound)?;
    let mut project = Project::new("docs-media")?;
    project.add("cell", Note::basic(image.image(), sound.sound()))?;
    let css = Media::bytes(b".card { color: navy; }".to_vec(), "text/css")?
        .with_export_name("course.css")?;
    project.add_asset(css)?;
    let built = project.build(BuildOptions::to(output.join("media.apkg")))?;
    verify(&built, 1, 1, 3)?;
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

## 组合内容与显式资源

这份完整程序使用 `fixtures/pixel.png`、`fixtures/silence.wav` 和 `fixtures/labels.woff`。在应用中请传入自己的源路径。测试字体是仓库中允许再分发的测试用字体。

```rust
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Content, Field, Media, NoteType, Project, Template};

fn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let image = Media::file("fixtures/pixel.png")?.with_export_name("badge.png")?;
    let sound = Media::file("fixtures/silence.wav")?;
    let font = Media::file("fixtures/labels.woff")?.with_export_name("labels.woff")?;
    let model = NoteType::builder("media-card")
        .field(Field::new("front"))
        .field(Field::new("back"))
        .template(Template::new("card")
            .front(r#"{{front}}<img src="badge.png">"#)
            .back("{{FrontSide}}<hr>{{back}}"))
        .css("@font-face { font-family: labels; src: url('labels.woff'); } .card { font-family: labels; }")
        .asset(font)
        .asset(image.clone())
        .build()?;
    let mut project = Project::new("media-guide")?;
    project.add("cell", model.note()
        .field("front", Content::sequence([Content::text("Cell "), image.image()]))
        .field("back", sound.sound()))?;
    let output = project.build(BuildOptions::to("media-guide.apkg"))?;
    assert_eq!(output.report().counts().media, 3);
    Ok(())
}
```

类型化的 `image()` 和 `sound()` 值会保留依赖直至导出。手写 HTML、CSS 或脚本引用需要 `builder.asset(media)` 或 `project.add_asset(media)`；库不会从任意字符串推断文件内容。即使没有可被静态识别的引用，显式资源仍会被包含。

向 `with_export_name` 传入原始文件名。类型化声音引用在渲染时会转义 HTML 实体，因此 `tone&copy;.mp3` 仍引用该原名资源。不要预先转义文件名。声音文件名中的百分号和片段字符保持字面含义，并不是 URL 路径。

## 名称、MIME 与预算

默认导出名称由内容决定，与源路径无关。需要固定文件名时，应在创建引用前使用 `with_export_name`。重命名某个克隆不会改变之前的克隆或内容节点。

名称不能包含路径、控制字符或不可移植的保留名称。冲突检查使用 Unicode NFC 加大小写折叠：仅大小写或规范化形式不同也会冲突。名称与内容完全相同的重复操作具有幂等性；同名不同内容会失败，不留下部分注册状态。

包括扩展名在内的完整导出文件名最多为 255 个 UTF-8 字节。Project 与模板包的 JSON Schema 检查文件名语法和字符数；加载器还检查字节预算。例如，重复 128 次的 `é` 能通过 schema 字符限制，却占 256 字节，加载时返回 `MEDIA.EXPORT_NAME_INVALID`。构建前通过 `tools::load_project` 或 `NoteType::from_bundle` 校验完整输入。

MIME 语法必须与可识别的内容一致。原生字节没有 64 KiB 的内联限制。默认导入预算为每个资源 256 MiB；`file_with_limits` 和 `bytes_with_limits` 在读取前接收 `MediaLimits { max_bytes }`。大快照可能写入临时存储，并在最后一个所有者消失后清理。快照所有权不保证在源文件同时被修改的导入过程中获得原子的文件系统视图。

Project JSON 解码内联 `bytes` 数组时使用相同的默认单资源预算。遇到首个超限字节便停止，不再收集剩余数组，并保留带限制和已观察字节数的 `MediaError`。拒绝时的计数是下界，并非尚未读取数组的总大小。

有效的媒体包并不证明所有 Anki 客户端都能播放其编解码格式。请在目标客户端测试图片、声音和字体。参见[排查问题](../troubleshooting.md#media-and-templates)。

### 类型化图片与声音的使用

构造函数保持不会失败。`Project::add` 检查导入时保留的 MIME：图片要求 `image/*`，声音引用接受 `audio/*` 和 `video/*`。`application/octet-stream`、文本、字体和 PDF 的类型化用法会返回 `NOTE.MEDIA_USAGE_INVALID`；用于原始 HTML/CSS 时应注册为显式资源。有效但未知的图片或视频 MIME 声明可以通过类别校验，但这并不认证解码器或播放器支持这些字节。重命名文件不会改变已保留的 MIME。构建仍会探测暂存字节并独立校验导出扩展名：名为 `wrong.mp3` 的 PNG 可以通过图片添加，却在构建时返回 `MEDIA.DECLARED_MIME_MISMATCH`。

<a id="batch-import-from-source"></a>

## 批量媒体导入

这些方法已包含在公开 `0.3.1` 包中。

以受限并发导入一组文件，保持输入顺序，并保留拥有所有权的媒体快照供之后导出：

```rust
use ankiforge::Media;
let images = Media::files(["first.png", "second.png"])?;
```

Node 使用 `await Media.files(['first.png', 'second.png'])`；Python 使用 `Media.files(['first.png', 'second.png'])`。

### 批量行为与预算

Rust 使用 `Media::files(paths)`，Node 使用 `await Media.files(paths)`，Python 使用 `Media.files(paths)`，按输入顺序导入文件，每次调用最多四个工作线程。少于 16 个文件时串行运行。Rust 还提供 `files_with_limits`；Node 和 Python 接受与 `file` 相同的限制。限制按每个资源计算。若某项导入失败，调用会等待已启动的工作完成、释放此批次的快照，并返回输入顺序中的第一个错误。已有媒体所有者继续有效。Python 在导入期间释放 GIL；Node 在事件循环之外执行工作。单文件导入仍立即产生拥有所有权的快照；调用方必须选择批量方法才能获得导入并发。

存活快照共享进程级 **64 MiB** 内存预算。单个大于 1 MiB 的资源仍流式写入临时文件。编码媒体在每次预备处理中共享延迟分配的 **16 MiB** 缓冲池，池满后写入临时存储。这些预算不包含其他工作内存，也不是 RSS 上限；并发构建各自可以拥有编码池。

docs/zh-cn/node-api.md.text:
# Node 与 TypeScript API

`ankiforge` 入口提供唯一的 Project 内容编写模型。类型定义位于[公开源码](../../bindings/node/src/index.ts)、[报告类](../../bindings/node/src/report.ts)及 [JSON 快照声明](../../bindings/node/src/snapshots.ts)。从[入门](../node/quick-start.md)开始。

## Project 与笔记

| API | 行为 |
| --- | --- |
| `new Project(namespace)` | 校验稳定发布命名空间 |
| `.defaultDeck(name)` | 设置默认目标；返回项目 |
| `.add(key, note)` | 原子收集笔记、模型和媒体；重复键失败 |
| `.addAsset(media)` | 包含显式原始 HTML/CSS/脚本资源 |
| `.clone()` | 独立可编辑项目，共享不可变值 |
| `.length` | 已注册笔记数 |
| `Note.basic(front, back)` / `Note.cloze(text)` | 持有内置模型的不可变笔记 |
| `model.note().field(key, content)` | 持有模型的不可变自定义笔记 |
| `note.deck(name).tag(tag).tags(iterable)` | 返回重新配置的笔记 |

字符串始终成为 Text，包括 Cloze 字符串。显式标记使用 `Content.html`。`Content.sequence(iterable)` 组合文本、HTML 与类型化媒体。使用显式业务键；内容和显示名称都不会派生身份。

## 不可变模型

```js
import { NoteType, Field, Template, GenerationRule } from 'ankiforge';
const model = NoteType.builder('vocabulary')
  .name('词汇')
  .field(new Field('front', { name: '正面', required: true, sort: true }))
  .field(new Field('back', { name: '背面' }))
  .template(new Template('recognition', {
    front: '{{front}}',
    back: '{{FrontSide}}<hr>{{back}}',
    generation: GenerationRule.all(['front']),
  }))
  .build();
const note = model.note().field('front', 'cell').field('back', '细胞');
```

构建器返回新值。完成的模型没有修改字段或模板的方法。`builder.clozeField(key)` 选择自定义 Cloze 语义；`builder.css` 与 `builder.asset` 提供样式和显式依赖。模板还接受 `name`、`browserFront`、`browserBack` 和 `targetDeck`。模板引用及生成条件使用字段键，显示名称编译后供 Anki 使用。`GenerationRule.ankiDefault()` 选择 Anki 默认行为；`all` 和 `any` 选择显式条件。

`await NoteType.fromBundle(path, mediaLimits?)` 从 `template-bundle-v2` 返回相同的不可变模型。成功后导入文本和资源不再依赖源目录。模型可跨项目复用；同一模型键下不兼容的定义会原子地失败。

## 媒体与图片遮挡

`await Media.file(path, limits?)` 和 `await Media.bytes(Uint8Array, mime, limits?)` 返回拥有所有权的快照。await 成功后源文件可改变或消失。`withExportName(name)` 返回重命名值，不改变之前的克隆或内容。通过属性读取 `filename`、`mediaType` 和 `byteLength`。

`media.image()` 与 `.sound()` 返回自动将资源带入项目的类型化 Content。显式 `project.addAsset` 与模型 `builder.asset` 处理原始 HTML/CSS/脚本引用。媒体限制接受 `{ maxBytes }`，默认为 256 MiB；原生字节没有 64 KiB 内联限制。

```js
import { Media, Note, Mask } from 'ankiforge';
const image = await Media.file('diagram.png');
const note = Note.imageOcclusion(image)
  .mask(Mask.rect('nucleus', 10, 10, 20, 20))
  .mask(Mask.rect('wall', 50, 50, 20, 20))
  .mode('hide_one_guess_one')
  .build().field('header', 'Cell');
```

默认模式为 `hide_all_guess_one`；两种模式都为带键遮罩生成独立卡片。`.build()` 校验解码尺寸、有限矩形和唯一键。`image` 与 `occlusion` 是保留的生成字段。解码与更新限制见[图片遮挡](../image-occlusion.md)。

## 构建、比较与输出

| API | 结果 |
| --- | --- |
| `await project.build(BuildOptions.to(path))` | 拥有持久产物的 BuildOutput |
| `await project.build(BuildOptions.temporary())` | 拥有临时产物的 BuildOutput |
| `await project.compare(CompareOptions.against(path))` | 完成的 ComparisonReport，包括被阻止的策略 |
| `options.updateFrom(path)` | 配置基于完整原始分发证据的更新 |
| `options.inspectLimits(limits)` | 覆盖独立检查计数器 |
| `options.updatePolicy(policy)` | 配置更新/比较风险策略 |

成功输出提供 `.artifact`、`.report` 与 `.snapshot()`。`BuildReport` 提供 `.counts`、`.baselineCounts`、`.durationMs`、`.diagnostics`、`.comparison` 和 `.snapshot()`；没有结果或文件所有权。`.comparison` 是 `ComparisonReport` 或 `null`，与 `project.compare()` 使用同一类。比较对象提供 `.findings`、`.highestRisk`、`.policy`、`.diagnostics` 和 `.snapshot()`。快照字段名对应 Rust JSON，包括 `allows_publication` 与 `schema_version`，并非原生报告的 camelCase 副本。检查非 `null` 后，在比较对象上使用 `report.comparison.highestRisk`，在 JSON 快照中使用 `report.snapshot().comparison.highest_risk`。

`new UpdatePolicy()` 阻止 High/Critical。`.failOn('medium')` 改变阈值。`.allow('RISK.NOTE_REMOVED')` 显式接受整个类别，保留证据和严重程度。未知码和硬错误不能放行。仅新建构建上设置策略会报错。需要相同发布决策时，对 compare 和 build 使用相同策略与限制。

检查选项包括 `maxArchiveBytes`、`maxEntries`、`maxCentralDirectoryBytes`、`maxZipEntryBytes`、`maxZipTotalBytes`、`maxMetaBytes`、`maxMediaMapBytes`、`maxIdentityBytes`、`maxCollectionBytes`、`maxMediaBytes`、`maxDecodedTotalBytes` 和 `maxZstdWindowBytes`。值可为非负安全整数，或不超过 u64 最大值的 `bigint`；零是实际零预算。计数器独立应用于基线与候选包。未知选项失败。

## 产物寿命与并发

JSON 快照路径使用导出的 `PathSnapshot` 类型。Unicode 路径为字符串；非 Unicode 原生路径使用 `{ encoding: "unix_bytes", bytes: number[] }` 或 `{ encoding: "windows_wide", units: number[] }`。数组保留精确的 Unix 字节或 Windows UTF-16 代码单元，适用于构建快照中的产物路径、失败发布路径及结构化错误路径详情。只在原平台解码路径；Unix 中 `Buffer.from(value.bytes)` 为 Node 文件系统函数保留字节路径。Node 内容编写方法仍接受字符串路径。

相对媒体和模板包路径在调用读取时锚定；构建目标和基线在构建选项时锚定。POSIX 中，符号链接后接 `..` 保留文件系统遍历语义。`persistTo` 将相对目标锚定到原构建捕获的工作目录，包括克隆和持久化句柄。之后的工作目录变化不会重定向这些路径。

消费 `.path` 时保持产物所有者存活。`.clone()` 创建独立所有者；`await .close()` 释放该所有者。最后一个临时所有者删除文件。`await .persistTo(path)` 返回持久产物，失败时原所有者也仍可用。保留所有者期间，标准 Node 文件流可以读取产物。

快照是冻结的 JSON 数据，不保留原生文件。持久文件在所有者清理后仍存在。调用方不能构造 `BuildOutput`；它只由成功构建创建。

Build 与 compare 异步运行，使用调用时捕获并拥有所有权的项目快照。后续编辑不能改变该请求。媒体读取和模板包加载也在工作线程上执行。Node ESM 与 CJS 共享相同原生模块和类身份。

## 错误

`SchemaError`、`AddError`、`MediaError`、`TemplateBundleError`、`ImageOcclusionError`、`PolicyError`、`ConfigurationError`、`CompareError`、`BuildError` 和 `PersistError` 继承 `ForgeError`。它们提供 `kind`、`code`、`domain`、`causes` 中的原生来源链文本、用于已识别 I/O/schema/媒体/限制原因的结构化 `sourceDetails`，以及操作 `details`。原始原生异常保留为 JS `cause`。

`BuildError.snapshot()` 保留失败与发布事实。`BuildError.report` 和 `CompareError.report` 与 `BuildOutput.report` 一样返回 `BuildReport`。报告使用 `.baselineCounts` 和 `.comparison`；snake_case JSON 字段通过 `.snapshot()` 访问。失败比较可能只有部分观察结果，且 comparison 为 `null`。`PersistError.publication` 记录目标是否已发布、持久性是否确认。媒体或检查错误保留限制详情。请使用机器字段，不解析错误消息。`ArtifactClosedError` 表示使用已关闭所有者；`NativeLoadError` 表示原生包缺失、不兼容或陈旧。

## 添加上下文

添加失败不会改变项目。结构化上下文记录原始笔记或模型键和目标，并可附带冲突或媒体用法详情。Rust 通过 `AddError::context()` / `detail()` 提供 `note::{AddContext, AddTarget, AddDetail}`；SDK 通过 `AddError.details` 提供类型化 context/detail。Node 字段使用 camelCase 且深度冻结；Python 使用 snake_case TypedDict。标签保留插入下标；字段位置保留原始序列下标（null/None 指字段，[] 指其根）以及可选 UTF-8 字节范围。构建产生的默认牌组错误不带笔记或模型键，仍可从来源链读取。

添加时，类型化图片要求 image/* MIME，声音引用接受 audio/* 或 video/*。其他类别产生 `NOTE.MEDIA_USAGE_INVALID`。构造函数保持不会失败；显式资源和原始 HTML 不受影响。检查使用导入时保留的 MIME，不认证播放能力。构建的独立 MIME/扩展名校验仍然适用。完整 target/detail 表见[设计](../plans/2026-09-28-rust-api-validation-and-errors-design.md)。

<a id="source-api-details"></a>

## 批量媒体与预备发布

批量媒体与预备发布已包含在公开 `0.3.1` 包中。

### 预备、审阅与发布

```js
import { Project, Note, BuildOptions, BuildError } from 'ankiforge';
const project = new Project('review-once').add('one', Note.basic('Question', 'Answer'));
const previous = await project.build(BuildOptions.to('previous.apkg'));
await previous.artifact.close();
const prepared = await project.preparePublication(
  BuildOptions.to('next.apkg').updateFrom('previous.apkg'),
);
try {
  const report = prepared.report; // immutable observations, no file ownership
  console.log(report.comparison?.snapshot());
  if (report.comparison?.policy.allows_publication !== false) {
    const output = await prepared.publish();
    await output.artifact.close(); // persistent next.apkg remains
  }
} catch (error) {
  if (error instanceof BuildError) console.log(error.snapshot().result);
  // Inspect publication/durability facts: a late failure can follow replacement.
  throw error;
} finally {
  await prepared.close(); // idempotent; cleans an unpublished candidate
}
```

`publish()` 立即取得原生所有者并执行一个工作线程任务。每次尝试都会消耗它，包括策略或 I/O 拒绝。重复调用以 `PreparedPublicationStateError` 拒绝，码为 `BUILD.PREPARED_UNAVAILABLE`，`reason` 为 `consumed` 或 `closed`。发布开始后关闭不会取消它。关闭后报告仍可读。选项在预备调用时绑定；改变策略或目标需要重新预备。耗时不含审阅等待。报告和 JSON 都不能转换回所有者。

构建、比较、预备和克隆共享不可变原生 Project 版本。内容编写更改仍同步且隔离。当另一快照存活时，第一次更改可能复制 Project；之后独占更改不会。这将复制移出 Promise 提交阶段，但不承诺首次编辑更快、最差定时器延迟更好或 RSS 更低。JavaScript 字节输入仍在提交工作线程前复制。此包装层使用协议 6 二进制。

## TypeScript

在应用中安装 `typescript` 和 `@types/node`。使用 `main.mts` 或 `"type": "module"`，以及以下 `tsconfig.json`：

```json
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "module": "NodeNext",
    "moduleResolution": "NodeNext",
    "strict": true,
    "outDir": "dist"
  }
}
```

使用 `npx tsc` 编译；`.mts` 入口随后运行 `node dist/main.mjs`。

docs/zh-cn/updates.md.text:
# 更新与分发

保持项目命名空间和笔记、模型、字段、模板键稳定。每次新版本基于之前的**原始分发 APKG** 构建，该包携带完整、带版本的身份证据。将包和源代码修订一起保存。

## 运行两个版本并比较

```sh
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example docs_workflow -- target/docs-examples
```

这会写出 `spanish-v1.apkg` 和 `spanish-v2.apkg`，比较修改后的答案，并检查更新包的数量。可执行源码如下：

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/docs_workflow.rs#updates -->
```rust
fn vocabulary(answer: &str) -> anyhow::Result<Project> {
    let mut project = Project::new("docs-spanish-updates")?.default_deck("Spanish");
    project.add("hola", Note::basic("hola", answer))?;
    Ok(project)
}

fn updates(output: &Path) -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let previous = output.join("spanish-v1.apkg");
    let next = output.join("spanish-v2.apkg");
    vocabulary("hello")?.build(BuildOptions::to(&previous))?;
    let project = vocabulary("hello; hi")?;
    let comparison = project.compare(CompareOptions::against(&previous))?;
    ensure!(comparison.policy().allows_publication());
    let built = project.build(BuildOptions::to(&next).update_from(&previous))?;
    verify(&built, 1, 1, 0)?;
    ensure!(built.report().comparison().is_some());
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

即使发现项会阻止发布，`compare` 也可以成功完成。请分别读取 `comparison.policy().allows_publication()`、原始风险级别和证据。`build(...update_from(...))` 执行相同分析；若策略阻止候选包，则在发布前返回 `BuildError`。

## 策略与检查限制

这份完整程序选择更严格的阈值，并对比较和更新使用相同配置：

```rust
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Note, Project};
use ankiforge::build::InspectLimits;
use ankiforge::update::{CompareOptions, RiskLevel, UpdatePolicy};

fn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {
    let mut first = Project::new("policy-example")?;
    first.add("cell", Note::basic("Cell?", "Unit of life"))?;
    first.build(BuildOptions::to("policy-v1.apkg"))?;
    let mut next = Project::new("policy-example")?;
    next.add("cell", Note::basic("Cell?", "The basic unit of life"))?;
    let mut limits = InspectLimits::default();
    limits.max_collection_bytes = 1 << 30;
    let policy = UpdatePolicy::default().fail_on(RiskLevel::Medium);
    let comparison = next.compare(CompareOptions::against("policy-v1.apkg")
        .inspect_limits(limits.clone()).update_policy(policy.clone()))?;
    assert!(comparison.policy().allows_publication());
    next.build(BuildOptions::to("policy-v2.apkg").update_from("policy-v1.apkg")
        .inspect_limits(limits).update_policy(policy))?;
    Ok(())
}
```

默认策略阻止 High 和 Critical 发现项。审阅特定类别后，调用方可有意选择 `UpdatePolicy::default().allow(RiskCode::NoteRemoved)`。它放行**该类别中的所有发现项**，同时保留原级别和证据；并不表示逐条批准指定笔记。没有匹配发现项的放行会产生警告；未知风险码被拒绝。不要自动放行比较返回的每一个码。

缺失或损坏的证据、命名空间不匹配、无效候选数据和检查限制都是硬错误，不是可放行的风险类别。分析无法完成时，比较返回错误及已完成的观察结果。对没有 `update_from` 的新建请求显式设置策略属于配置错误，与 setter 调用顺序无关。

## 证据与身份

包内包含 `ankiforge-identity.json`，格式为 `ankiforge-identity-v1`。它将模型或配置 ID、笔记 GUID、历史字段或模板槽位、卡片或遮罩序号、修订和媒体绑定到实际集合与载荷。Anki 重新导出不保留该证据，不能作为更新基线。缺失证据绝不会被静默重建。

显示名称和内容编辑保留身份键。内容未变时保留基线修订；内容改变时推进修订。字段或模板重排保留历史映射。退役身份继续保留，恢复相同键时可复用。笔记键不能移到另一模型，模型键也不能在普通与 Cloze 类型间改变。

## 客户端导入行为与发布检查

APKG 是分发包，不是删除同步。省略笔记、字段、模板或遮罩，不会删除学习者已有数据。字段或模板 schema 和排序字段变化属于高风险，因为 Anki 合并与导入设置会影响行为。Schema 变化可能复制模型，或在笔记内容比较前更新目标笔记的时间戳。

在支持的客户端测试首次导入以及导入已有集合的更新。使用目标合并与笔记更新设置，检查字段、GUID、卡片集合、本地编辑和已有调度。仅稳定身份不保证较新本地编辑被覆盖，也不保证已删除的历史被恢复。

将候选包写到与归档基线不同的路径。审阅后分发被接受的包，并将它保留为下一次发布的证据。所有权和发布事实见[构建保证](../build-guarantees.md)。

<a id="build-once-review-then-publish-from-source"></a>

## 构建一次，审阅后发布

此 API 已包含在公开 `0.3.1` 包中。

构建一次，检查报告，然后发布同一个候选文件。审阅后再运行一次普通构建会创建另一个候选包；预备发布使实际 APKG 始终与已审阅报告对应。

<!-- source: anki_forge/examples/docs_publication.rs -->
```rust
use ankiforge::{BuildOptions, Note, Project};

fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let mut project = Project::new("spanish")?.default_deck("Spanish");
    project.add("es:hola", Note::basic("hola", "hello"))?;
    project.build(BuildOptions::to("spanish-original.apkg"))?;

    let mut next = Project::new("spanish")?.default_deck("Spanish");
    next.add("es:hola", Note::basic("hola", "hello; hi"))?;
    let prepared = next.prepare_publication(
        BuildOptions::to("spanish-reviewed.apkg").update_from("spanish-original.apkg"),
    )?;
    println!("{:?}", prepared.report().comparison());
    if prepared
        .report()
        .comparison()
        .is_some_and(|report| report.policy().allows_publication())
    {
        let output = prepared.publish()?;
        println!("{}", output.artifact().path().display());
    }
    Ok(())
}
```
<!-- /source -->

在固定修订的源码目录中，把上面的完整程序保存为 `anki_forge/examples/docs_publication.rs`（本指南新增该示例；`1199196` 中未包含它），然后运行：

```sh
cargo run --locked -p ankiforge --example docs_publication
```

示例在仓库根目录写出 `spanish-original.apkg`，并在策略允许发布时写出 `spanish-reviewed.apkg`。预备阶段不发布到目标。批准分发前，应审阅发现项并测试客户端导入；此示例只在策略允许时自动发布这次简单内容编辑。基准测试未测量该流程。

参见[构建生命周期](../build-guarantees.md#prepared-publication-from-source)、[Rust API](../rust-api.md#review-once-publish-once)、[Node API](../node/api.md#prepare-review-and-publish)和 [Python API](../python/api.md#prepare-review-and-publish)。

